496
00:33:49,260 --> 00:33:51,062
It's quite clear that if

497
00:33:51,062 --> 00:33:54,265
you look at retail, warehouse,

498
00:33:54,265 --> 00:33:57,335
storage, retail, warehouse, storage

499
00:33:57,902 --> 00:34:00,471
inside of Ukraine,

500
00:34:00,471 --> 00:34:04,675
that estimates from high level
government officials are

501
00:34:04,909 --> 00:34:07,979
that the Russians have destroyed 90%

502
00:34:08,312 --> 00:34:11,015
of retail warehouse storage,

503
00:34:11,015 --> 00:34:17,021
which has a significant effect
on the Russian economy.

504
00:34:17,021 --> 00:34:21,592
And the Russians up to now
have either damaged

505
00:34:21,592 --> 00:34:27,098
or destroyed about 80% of Ukraine's

506
00:34:28,266 --> 00:34:30,735
energy infrastructure.

507
00:34:30,735 --> 00:34:36,707
Just think about the Russians up to now
have destroyed about 80% of destroyed

508
00:34:36,707 --> 00:34:41,045
or damaged about 80% of Ukraine's energy
infrastructure.

509
00:34:41,145 --> 00:34:43,781
A lot of that has been repaired.

510
00:34:43,781 --> 00:34:48,286
I want to be clear, but what the Russians
are now saying that they're going to do

511
00:34:48,286 --> 00:34:51,589
is they're going to destroy that

512
00:34:51,589 --> 00:34:54,959
energy infrastructure almost completely.

513
00:34:54,992 --> 00:34:59,430
They're going to purposely target that
infrastructure, that energy infrastructure

514
00:34:59,430 --> 00:35:04,168
for the purpose of with the goal
in mind of destroying it.

515
00:35:04,168 --> 00:35:06,871
So you can see what's happening here.

516
00:35:06,871 --> 00:35:12,043
And that is that the Russians are no
longer engaged in a punishment campaign.

517
00:35:12,076 --> 00:35:15,046
They're interested in wrecking

518
00:35:15,313 --> 00:35:20,051
the Ukrainian economy to the point
where it will

519
00:35:20,051 --> 00:35:24,422
