it's quite clear that the Russians are

528
00:36:06,264 --> 00:36:11,936
at a significant advantage or have a
significant advantage over the Ukrainians.

529
00:36:11,969 --> 00:36:15,673
Now, just one final point on this,
and that is that if you look

530
00:36:15,706 --> 00:36:22,613
at the Ukrainian air campaign
against Russia, which is being waged

531
00:36:22,613 --> 00:36:26,984
with drones, there's no question
that that is inflicting

532
00:36:26,984 --> 00:36:30,221
punishment on Russia.

533
00:36:30,288 --> 00:36:32,657
We want to be very clear on that point.

534
00:36:32,657 --> 00:36:36,227
The Ukrainian drone campaign is inflicting

535
00:36:36,227 --> 00:36:41,132
punishment on Russia,
but that punishment campaign

536
00:36:41,132 --> 00:36:47,004
is not going to cause Russia to surrender

537
00:36:47,004 --> 00:36:53,044
or to reduce its goals in this war.

538
00:36:53,110 --> 00:36:58,382
If anything, it's going to incentivize
