540
00:37:01,986 --> 00:37:04,855
air campaign against Ukraine

541
00:37:06,390 --> 00:37:08,893
to the highest possible level.

542
00:37:08,893 --> 00:37:12,296
So the Ukrainians have no war

543
00:37:12,296 --> 00:37:15,533
winning strategy
