544
00:37:15,533 --> 00:37:19,937
And when you read all these stories
about how successful

545
00:37:20,004 --> 00:37:24,342
this drone attack or that drone attack
by Ukraine against Russia is,

546
00:37:24,375 --> 00:37:28,179
you should understand
it's not going to influence the outcome

547
00:37:28,212 --> 00:37:31,215
of this war in any meaningful way.

548
00:37:32,116 --> 00:37:36,020
So that concludes my discussion

549
00:37:36,020 --> 00:37:39,890
