550
00:37:40,057 --> 00:37:44,829
I want to talk now about outside support
for Ukraine,

551
00:37:45,096 --> 00:37:50,701
as I think everybody understands Ukraine
could have never stayed in this war

552
00:37:50,735 --> 00:37:55,773
without support from the West,
especially from the United States.

553
00:37:57,675 --> 00:38:03,381
And if you think about where we are today
and where we're headed, it's quite clear

554
00:38:03,381 --> 00:38:07,551
that US support for
Ukraine has been reduced

555
00:38:07,551 --> 00:38:11,856
significantly
since the war started in February 2022.

556
00:38:12,923 --> 00:38:15,926
The United States, under President Trump,

557
00:38:16,594 --> 00:38:20,131
