559
00:38:24,335 --> 00:38:29,573
the American burden of supporting
Ukraine and shift

560
00:38:29,573 --> 00:38:32,576
that burden onto the shoulders

561
00:38:32,610 --> 00:38:35,246
of the Europeans.

562
00:38:35,246 --> 00:38:38,115
So the United States is interested

563
00:38:38,115 --> 00:38:42,353
in reducing its commitment to Ukraine

564
00:38:42,420 --> 00:38:45,423
to take this further.

565
00:38:45,790 --> 00:38:48,526
Remember that the United States,

566
00:38:48,526 --> 00:38:51,329
because of what's happened in the Gulf

567
00:38:51,329 --> 00:38:55,933
War, has a significant shortage
of precious munitions.

568
00:38:55,933 --> 00:39:00,738
For example, it has a significant shortage
