573
00:39:17,188 --> 00:39:21,525
But the United States has no Patriot
missiles

574
00:39:21,592 --> 00:39:24,495
that it can give to the Ukrainians.

575
00:39:24,495 --> 00:39:27,932
The Ukrainians,
therefore, have virtually no defense

576
00:39:27,932 --> 00:39:31,969
against the incoming
ballistic and cruise missiles from Russia.

577
00:39:31,969 --> 00:39:36,107
And that situation is not going to change
anytime soon.

578
00:39:36,140 --> 00:39:41,746
The United States is not in a position
where it can give lots of weaponry to

579
00:39:42,813 --> 00:39:43,547
Ukraine.

580
00:39:43,547 --> 00:39:48,252
And furthermore, the United States, as I
said, is interested in shifting the burden

581
00:39:48,753 --> 00:39:54,325
of supporting Ukraine from its shoulders
to the European shoulders.

582
00:39:54,392 --> 00:39:58,396
On top of all that, the United States
has just initiated the study

583
00:39:59,196 --> 00:40:02,900
to assess what sort of troop levels

584
