585
00:40:08,406 --> 00:40:11,142
and given the imperative

586
00:40:11,142 --> 00:40:15,446
of pivoting to Asia and giving
what's going on in the Middle East,

587
00:40:15,546 --> 00:40:18,749
it's almost certain that the United States
is going to reduce

588
00:40:18,749 --> 00:40:21,752
its troop levels in

589
00:40:21,786 --> 00:40:26,257
Europe in the not too distant future,
and this is just going to be another sign

590
00:40:26,290 --> 00:40:30,461
of America's
reduced commitment to Ukraine.

591
00:40:30,461 --> 00:40:36,167
So you see, you have a situation here
where the American commitment to Europe,

592
00:40:36,233 --> 00:40:38,235
I don't want to say
it's been withering away.

593
00:40:38,235 --> 00:40:42,606
That's too strong,
but it has been greatly reduced over time.

594
00:40:42,606 --> 00:40:44,675
It hasn't been reduced to zero.

595
00:40:44,675 --> 00:40:49,413
But the United States is no longer
the loyal supporter of Ukraine

596
00:40:49,413 --> 00:40:50,781
that it once was.

597
00:40:50,781 --> 00:40:53,884
And if you look at the European countries,
relations

598
