602
00:41:08,566 --> 00:41:11,902
and Ukraine,
because Ukraine has been supporting

603
00:41:12,803 --> 00:41:15,706
or has been celebrating

604
00:41:15,706 --> 00:41:18,776
its history in World War two,

605
00:41:19,543 --> 00:41:23,414
in which Ukrainian forces massacred poles,

606
00:41:23,414 --> 00:41:27,051
which has enraged poles
and therefore Polish.

607
00:41:27,051 --> 00:41:30,321
Ukrainian relations are terrible today.

608
00:41:30,354 --> 00:41:35,826
And if you look at what's happening inside
