611
00:41:46,403 --> 00:41:49,507
it's likely that France or Germany

612
00:41:50,007 --> 00:41:55,446
will abandon its strong support
for Ukraine, because the right in Germany

613
00:41:55,446 --> 00:41:58,449
and the right in France have made it clear

614
00:41:58,616 --> 00:42:00,885
that they have no love lost for NATO.

615
00:42:00,885 --> 00:42:01,585
Number one.

616
00:42:01,585 --> 00:42:07,525
And number two,
they think it's time to end this

617
00:42:08,192 --> 00:42:10,828
formidable be a German or be

618
00:42:10,828 --> 00:42:13,797
it French commitment to Ukraine.

619
00:42:13,797 --> 00:42:17,535
So when you look at the future

620
00:42:17,535 --> 00:42:22,273
and you think about Ukraine's
heavy dependance

