00:42:22,273 --> 00:42:26,143
on support from the United States
and from the Europeans,

622
00:42:26,844 --> 00:42:29,813
you don't see a pretty picture at all.

623
00:42:29,813 --> 00:42:34,218
And then I want to talk about
