648
00:44:14,218 --> 00:44:19,590
he was not only forced to fire Fedorov,
he was forced to fire General Syrskyi as well.

649
00:44:19,823 --> 00:44:25,129
And I believe the general Syrskyi was
a quite successful battlefield commander.

650
00:44:25,195 --> 00:44:28,465
I think one of the reasons,
not the only reason by any means,

651
00:44:28,465 --> 00:44:31,835
but one of the reasons that the Ukrainians
have been able to hold out

652
00:44:31,835 --> 00:44:36,373
against the Russians over
time was because of General Syrskyi

653
00:44:36,940 --> 00:44:40,744
who was, I think,
a quite competent military commander.

654
00:44:40,744 --> 00:44:43,714
But anyway, so

655
00:44:43,714 --> 00:44:46,483
Zelensky has been forced to fire Syrskyi.

656
00:44:46,483 --> 00:44:48,819
He was forced to fire Fedorov.

657
00:44:48,819 --> 00:44:50,754
And when you were in the middle
