forces,

660
00:44:58,328 --> 00:45:01,498
that tells you
that you are in serious trouble.

661
00:45:01,532 --> 00:45:04,902
So the point that I'm making here
is that if you look inside

662
00:45:04,902 --> 00:45:08,138
Kyiv,
there's all sorts of trouble brewing.

663
00:45:08,172 --> 00:45:12,176
And if you look at the outside support

664
00:45:12,176 --> 00:45:15,979
