672
00:45:44,875 --> 00:45:48,946
plus percent of Ukrainian territory.

673
00:45:49,012 --> 00:45:52,816
Of course,
they don't control all of that territory,

674
00:45:53,617 --> 00:45:56,987
but I would estimate they control

675
00:45:57,020 --> 00:46:01,592
slightly
more than 80% of those four oblasts.

676
00:46:01,625 --> 00:46:05,229
They control all of Crimea and about 80%

677
00:46:05,796 --> 00:46:08,665
of the four oblasts that they inex.

678
00:46:08,665 --> 00:46:11,535
And there are,
of course, in the process of conquering

679
00:46:11,535 --> 00:46:16,607
all of the territory
in those four oblasts.

680
00:46:16,740 --> 00:46:19,843
So if the war ended today,

681
00:46:20,177 --> 00:46:23,247
Ukraine would have lost

682
00:46:23,247 --> 00:46:26,250
about 20% of its territory.

683
00:46:27,184 --> 00:46:30,554
Not only has Ukraine
lost all this territory,

684
00:46:30,554 --> 00:46:35,526
but there's virtually no chance
it's going to become a member of NATO.

685
00:46:36,126 --> 00:46:39,329
First of all, NATO is a badly damaged

686
00:46:39,329 --> 00:46:42,332
institution as a result of this war.

687
00:46:42,533 --> 00:46:47,704
Serious damage has been done to NATO
because of the Ukraine war.

688
00:46:47,738 --> 00:46:51,675
And you see this very clearly in America's
interest

689
00:46:51,675 --> 00:46:58,182
