reducing its influence in NATO,

690
00:46:58,182 --> 00:47:01,185
and basically letting the Europeans play

691
00:47:01,185 --> 00:47:05,255
a much larger role
in terms of running the alliance.

692
00:47:05,255 --> 00:47:07,891
So I think the alliance is in trouble.

693
00:47:07,891 --> 00:47:11,295
But furthermore,
there's no way you're going to get

694
00:47:11,295 --> 00:47:15,432
a European consensus
to bring Ukraine into NATO.

695
00:47:15,432 --> 00:47:19,436
And furthermore, given
the state of Ukraine, given the damage

696
00:47:19,436 --> 00:47:24,007
that's been done to Ukraine,
Ukraine will be in no position

697
00:47:24,408 --> 00:47:27,578
to enter NATO or the EU for that matter.

698
00:47:27,911 --> 00:47:30,781
So again, you end the war today.

699
00:47:30,781 --> 00:47:35,819
Russia controls a huge slice
of Ukrainian territory in the East,

700
00:47:36,053 --> 00:47:39,256
and furthermore,
it has succeeded in preventing

701
00:47:39,790 --> 00:47:43,126
Ukraine from join in NATO.

702
00:47:43,260 --> 00:47:48,866
Finally,
huge destruction has been done to Ukraine.

703
00:47:48,899 --> 00:47:52,970
Estimates
are that it'll take $600 billion.

704
00:47:53,036 --> 00:47:54,171
Just think about that.

705
00:47:54,171 --> 00:47:57,608
$600 billion to repair

706
00:47:57,608 --> 00:48:01,278
all the damage
that has been done to Ukraine.

707
00:48:01,311 --> 00:48:06,183
And this doesn't take out take
into account the demographic consequences.

708
00:48:06,183 --> 00:48:09,820
All the people who have fled Ukraine
and will never come back.

709
00:48:09,853 --> 00:48:14,892
All the Ukrainians who have died before
this war started, it was commonplace

710
00:48:14,892 --> 00:48:19,162
for people to talk about Ukraine
being a demographic death spiral.

711
00:48:19,196 --> 00:48:24,034
If anything, that situation
has only been exacerbated.

712
00:48:24,067 --> 00:48:27,738
So in terms of where we are today
and the war,

713
00:48:28,572 --> 00:48:31,575
were that war to end today.

714
00:48:31,775 --> 00:48:34,711
I think it's quite clear that Ukraine

715
00:48:34,711 --> 00:48:37,714
is in a disastrous situation,

716
00:48:38,015 --> 00:48:41,418
and I think there is no chance

717
00:48:41,618 --> 00:48:44,688
that Ukraine can reverse this situation.

718
00:48:44,688 --> 00:48:48,091
Anybody who believes that

719
00:48:48,725 --> 00:48:51,194
Ukraine can recapture

720
00:48:51,194 --> 00:48:54,865
territory that it lost, that it can wage

721
00:48:54,865 --> 00:48:58,902
a strategic bombing campaign
